                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "297d415a-0ed1-3d71-bbf6-950bd1c846dc",
                        "entry_id": "4b619268-7642-3c75-9f77-3420ee7e07ae",
                        "glosses": [
                            "специалист, осуществляющий управление воздушным движением"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e75e2e5c-eb55-496c-bebe-e993c96f451d",
                                "sense_id": "297d415a-0ed1-3d71-bbf6-950bd1c846dc",
                                "text": "Субъект, кем бы он ни был: железнодорожный диспетчер, авиадиспетчер, лётчик или машинист электростанции, воспринимает показания приборов, расшифровывает их, принимает решение, выполняет соответствующее действие…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f04419a1-98e7-4522-bfa7-3f8dc95c2c07",
                                "sense_id": "297d415a-0ed1-3d71-bbf6-950bd1c846dc",
                                "text": "В 21.10 (2.10 ночи по местному времени) самолёт внезапно пропал с радаров авиадиспетчеров."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6a7d990f-902c-49ce-9658-f10f942cf7e5",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b619268-7642-3c75-9f77-3420ee7e07ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "297d415a-0ed1-3d71-bbf6-950bd1c846dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "air traffic controller",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "air traffic controller",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "378c4045-8cd8-323b-bd9f-e7613d705a9c",
                                        "entry_id": "7d011b07-6cd8-355e-93d4-5aa5e391a382",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who operates an air traffic control system, to expedite the safe flow of aircraft."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b7f8c19e-59cc-4eec-972e-a7d2c7a2f597",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b619268-7642-3c75-9f77-3420ee7e07ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "297d415a-0ed1-3d71-bbf6-950bd1c846dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "controller",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "controller",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06686f7f-4d1f-37cb-8ba4-67c23d6d162f",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who controls something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "278e6787-71fd-41f7-8a07-f01ab139df67",
                                                "sense_id": "06686f7f-4d1f-37cb-8ba4-67c23d6d162f",
                                                "text": "The great controller of our fate / Deigned to be man, and lived in low estate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2879b05a-c934-3b57-9df9-982c885d1aa7",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any electric or mechanical device for controlling a circuit or system."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd80d36a-bd22-48a1-ae4e-44749114b0dd",
                                                "sense_id": "2879b05a-c934-3b57-9df9-982c885d1aa7",
                                                "text": "Nothing more can be squeezed out of the motive power unit once the master controller has been moved to full on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8817b0d6-40bf-3645-af40-c72e7ff75151",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The chief accounting officer which audits, and manages the financial affairs of a company or government; a comptroller."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0cdf3c0b-e3ee-3176-bdec-5484e8b9d5e4",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mechanism that controls or regulates the operation of a machine, especially a peripheral device in a computer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eae78363-8055-3094-8a60-b1317a884192",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hardware device designed to allow the user to play video games."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d3ac51c-828f-466a-9165-819da8a3e0b6",
                                                "sense_id": "eae78363-8055-3094-8a60-b1317a884192",
                                                "text": "I'm collecting player's names for a school project. You know, players just like you! That's right, you--the one holding the controller. Would you register your name, please?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "48abd2e5-9424-3e81-87f0-864feee7bfcf",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An iron block, usually bolted to a ship's deck, for controlling the running out of a chain cable. The links of the cable tend to drop into hollows in the block, and thus hold fast until disengaged."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d4e71cf-a0fe-3499-a5de-8dddae87dea7",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The person who supervises and handles communication with an agent in the field."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6bee5386-6ad9-3599-a269-5df74b8bcccf",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The subject of a control verb. See Control (linguistics)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "71d91fbe-e609-4154-b608-8073d4cb7d1b",
                                                "sense_id": "6bee5386-6ad9-3599-a269-5df74b8bcccf",
                                                "text": "The choice of controller is determined by the matrix verb. If, as in (30b) and (3la), the main verb does not subcategorize for an OBJ, then the controller is the matrix SUBJ. In this case the complement clause is interpreted as having the same subject as the main clause. If the main verb does take an OBJ, the controller is the matrix patient."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "694e2178-5f1b-33d0-9b00-0497bc521bb0",
                                        "entry_id": "deedcc0d-afa3-32c8-9aa8-90cd4c80238d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In software applications using the model-view-controller design pattern, the part or parts of the application that treat input and output, forming an interface between models and views."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67be47e7-942a-48bb-9677-ff1186f81660",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b619268-7642-3c75-9f77-3420ee7e07ae",
                        "source_sense_id": "297d415a-0ed1-3d71-bbf6-950bd1c846dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fluglotse",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fluglotse",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1d370886-f69e-3240-abc9-96ce45122016",
                                        "entry_id": "b1de1d99-3283-3eef-bdb4-e7403f81a370",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die an einem Flughafen das Landen und Starten der Flugzeuge überwacht und regelt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ca8abba-e594-46f4-881e-62d99067504c",
                                                "sense_id": "1d370886-f69e-3240-abc9-96ce45122016",
                                                "text": "Der Fluglotse überwacht den Luftraum und leitet alle Luftfahrzeuge in seinem Zuständigkeitsbereich, soweit sie seiner Kontrolle unterliegen, um Zusammenstöße zu vermeiden (Flugsicherung), aber auch, um für die Fluggesellschaften eine möglichst ökonomische Durchführung der Flüge herzustellen und aufrecht zu erhalten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47cb4923-7012-49bb-aa34-c9fc248d6b74",
                                                "sense_id": "1d370886-f69e-3240-abc9-96ce45122016",
                                                "text": "Die Ausbildung eines Fluglotsen dauert in Deutschland etwa zwei bis drei Jahre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6d8a95b-a574-4184-ae67-837980bf82ad",
                                                "sense_id": "1d370886-f69e-3240-abc9-96ce45122016",
                                                "text": "Fluglotsen sind immer nur für einen bestimmten Bereich (Sektor) zuständig."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3f30490-3541-427c-ac06-cbca33dd00ff",
                                                "sense_id": "1d370886-f69e-3240-abc9-96ce45122016",
                                                "text": "„In diesem Jahr stand zum ersten Mal in der Schweiz ein Fluglotse wegen eines Vorfalls vor Gericht, bei dem niemand zu Schaden kam.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
